PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_AreYouReady::
    .string "Step into the battle area to face\n"
    .string "your next League opponent.\p"
    .string "Ready for a DOUBLE BATTLE?$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_ChampionRoomLocked::
    .string "Win four battles in this room\n"
    .string "to open the CHAMPION's door.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_ChampionAwaits::
    .string "All four victories are recorded!\p"
    .string "The north door is now open.\n"
    .string "The CHAMPION awaits you.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_PostBattle::
    .string "Victory {STR_VAR_1} of 4 recorded.\p"
    .string "Return to the battle area when\n"
    .string "you are ready for the next match.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_LoreleiIntro::
	.string "LORELEI: The arena is warm, but\nmy team is quite at home. Keep\pyour composure when the cold\ncloses in.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_LoreleiDefeat::
	.string "You stayed composed through it\nall.$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_BrunoIntro::
	.string "BRUNO: Every step here took\neffort! Put that effort behind\pyour commands. Hoo hah!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_BrunoDefeat::
	.string "Your training speaks for itself!$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_AgathaIntro::
	.string "AGATHA: OAK sent you out to\nlearn, did he? Let's see whether\pyou can surprise an old hand!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_AgathaDefeat::
	.string "Hah! There is life in this old\nchallenge yet!$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_LanceIntro::
	.string "LANCE: A dragon's strength needs\na trainer who can guide it. Show\pme how you guide your own team.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_LanceDefeat::
	.string "Your team answered with\nremarkable strength.$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_BrockIntro::
	.string "BROCK: We began with fragments\nand questions. Now show me the\pfoundation you've built since\nMT. MOON.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_BrockDefeat::
	.string "That foundation held firm.$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_MistyIntro::
	.string "MISTY: We've come a long way\nfrom those currents! My team\pwon't hold back. Let's make some\nwaves!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_MistyDefeat::
	.string "You found a way through every\nwave!$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_LtSurgeIntro::
	.string "LT. SURGE: Look who made the\nLEAGUE! Training's over, kid.\pShow me that voltage under\npressure!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_LtSurgeDefeat::
	.string "Now that's power you can rely\non!$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_ErikaIntro::
	.string "ERIKA: How lovely to meet here.\nI can see how your team has\pgrown. May we share another\nlesson?$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_ErikaDefeat::
	.string "Your care has borne wonderful\nfruit.$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_KogaIntro::
	.string "KOGA: Fwahahaha! No volcanic\ntrial today. Only your allies\pand mine. Show me the strength\nof that bond!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_KogaDefeat::
	.string "Together, you overcame my\ntechnique!$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_BlaineIntro::
	.string "BLAINE: Hah! A familiar face\nwith new ideas! Let's put those\pdiscoveries through a proper\nheat test!$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_BlaineDefeat::
	.string "A breakthrough! You burned past\nmy expectations!$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_SabrinaIntro::
	.string "SABRINA: The arena is full of\nexpectation. Let it pass. Listen\pto your partners, then answer\nme.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_SabrinaDefeat::
	.string "Your will and theirs moved\ntogether.$"


PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_GiovanniIntro::
	.string "GIOVANNI: You taught me what\ncontrol could not achieve.\pToday, my team and I will show\nyou what we have learned.$"

PokemonLeague_BrunosRoom_Text_GiovanniDefeat::
	.string "We have more to learn. A worthy\nresult.$"

